## Invariant

Mobile first paint and LCP must not wait on **unused** CDN fonts, **no-store of hashed static assets**, or **entire-page** client bundles. Hero design stays protected — optimize **how** assets load.

**Hero title (learned 2026-09-12 evening):** Owner wants **text only** over the hero video/image — **no** filled scrim panel (`bg-black/*` rounded box) behind title/subtitle. Any dark box makes the media look muddy. Prefer white copy + `drop-shadow` / `text-shadow` for readability. Do **not** re-add a title background panel for A11y/PSI alone. Category card scrims are separate (OK).

**PSI score vs header logo (learned 2026-09-12 10:11):** Owner re-uploaded a smaller transparent header logo (~16.5 KB) then saw Perf **75 → 69**. **Not caused by the logo.** Payload stayed **~3,247 → 3,249 KiB** (flat). Score fell because **LCP 4.8s → 6.1s** (weight +8 → +3) and **SI 7.1s → 8.5s**, plus TBT **80 → 120ms** — classic **lab variance / Slow-4G hero timing**. LCP element is **hero slide 1 video** (`hero-banner.mp4` ~**multi‑MB**) + poster WebP, not the sticky header logo (~17 KB). Do **not** blame CMS logo swaps for Perf swings of this size; re-run PSI or trim hero MP4 instead.

**External “Next Image + purge logo.png + Supabase preconnect” brief (learned 2026-09-12):** **Not the root cause** of Perf 69 / LCP 6.1s. Hero slide 1 is **video** (~1.7 MB); intentional `<img>` + `fetchPriority` / onError already used — do **not** rewrite Hero to `next/image` for this. Legacy `/images/logo.png` (~91 KB favicon/fallback) is not LCP. Supabase `preconnect` is optional micro-opt only. See `docs/storefront-mobile-lighthouse-2026-09-09.md` § Sep 12 external brief.

**External “defer hero video + prioritize LCP image” brief (learned 2026-09-12):** Diagnosis partly right (MP4 can contend on Slow 4G). **Already shipped:** mobile poster-first (~2.8s/idle), `preload="metadata"`, LCP = fallback WebP + `fetchPriority="high"` + `<link rel="preload" as="image">`. Do **not** re-do as Next `<Image fill>` refactor. **>85** needs **smaller admin MP4**, not this brief alone. See doc § defer video brief.

