## Do

- **Fonts:** Root Inter only (`display: swap`, preload). Customize/stamp fonts stay off `/` (`GoogleFontsLinks`).
- **JS:** `dynamic` / deferred Swiper (`LazyHomeSwiper`); avoid new whole-route `'use client'` weight on `/`.
- **Images:** Prefer CMS WebP under budgets; product AI `encodeStorefrontWebp`; Unsplash via `optimizeStorefrontImageUrl`.
- **Video hero:** On ≤1023px / Save-Data, show WebP fallback first and defer MP4 (~2.8s / idle); preload LCP href uses video `fallbackImage`. Desktop still loads video promptly. Admin smaller MP4 remains helpful.
- **Cache:** `/_next/static` immutable; `/images`, `/media`, logo/apple-touch = 1d + SWR; public site-config `s-maxage=60` SWR 300. HTML home may stay `no-store`. Do not blanket-`no-store` public CMS/catalog.
- **A11y:** Icon labels + captions; hero title = **no fill panel** — text + shadow only so video stays sharp; avoid `text-transparent`/`bg-clip-text` for body copy; footer `text-gray-300` on `bg-gray-900`. Hold A11y **100**.
- **3rd parties:** No new render-blocking scripts in root layout.
- **PSI reading:** Compare **LCP/SI/payload** across runs before attributing score drops to small CMS assets (header logo).

## Do not

- Redesign Hero logo / HOT ITEM / Framer / brand gradients.
- Re-add a filled hero title scrim panel (`bg-black/…` box behind SELPIC/subtitle) — owner prefers clear video + text-only (2026-09-12).
- Attribute large Perf drops to header-logo KB changes when payload is flat and LCP moved (2026-09-12 10:11).
- Treat generic “Hero must use next/image + delete logo.png + add Supabase preconnect” briefs as the LCP root cause — **learned false** for SELPIC (video hero; see doc).
- Pull accounting-sandbox into storefront webpack.
- Treat only desktop; assume Moto G / Slow 4G.
- Claim wins from older baselines — use latest PSI time (**10:11** Sep 12).

## When touching `/` or root layout / next.config headers

1. Re-read this rule + `homepage-protection.mdc`.
2. After meaningful perf work: PSI mobile — note vs **10:11** (69 / 6.1s LCP / TBT 120ms / SI 8.5s / ~3.2 MiB / A11y 100). Expect run-to-run LCP noise until hero MP4 is smaller.
